the XDefaults look ok, but I think your problem is, that .XDefaults
for a special user is xrdb'ed AFTER you login into the workstation!
So if you want to change the login screen, you have to set these resources
into root's .Xdefaults, because these are set, before the login window
is shown. Don't forget to restart your X-Server to make changes visible.

: - jae
