As another response indicated, you can do the conversion from within
ALL-IN-1.  However, you don't HAVE to convert the documents.  Even if
you relink ALL-IN-1 without WPS-PLUS, the documents can be read, printed
and will be edited with the user's default editor (presumably WordPerfect).

Users may want to convert their "living" documents to WordPerfect so no
WordPerfect-specific features are lost, but there is no reason to convert
all the old documents and mail messages.

