week or so.

This list is an attempt to coalesce all net knowledge on PDP-11 UNIBUS
and Q-bus modules. It is designed to supercede all the various homespun
lists floating around -- giving one solid source of information. So, with
that in mind, don't hesitate to send me your list. Don't worry about my
getting duplicates...

To insure the growth and survival of this list, please do any of the
following that you find appropriate:

1) Send me your PDP-11 module list.
2) Make corrections to this list and send them to me.
3) Give me options for module numbers or module numbers for options
   that I don't have.
4) Feel free to clarify any items on this list.
   (Clarifications *most* welcome! For instance, what exactly is an
   M7948 "Foundation" module?)

Just make sure you send anything you have to me.
If you have relevant hardcopy and you don't feel like typing it in,
get in contact with me and we'll work something out.

(Note: as of right now, this list is in an horridly unordered state,
but that is soon to change! Also, you'll find some uVAX modules on
here... I am including them, as they don't really warrant a separate
list.)


Credits List:
Tim Shoppa
Bob Hoffman
Nick Laflamme
LEE HAVEMANN

