Basically, the TA90E is a TA91 in a TA90-style cabinet.

The TA90E added compression to the TA90, while the TA91 is basically smaller
footprint packaging and continues with the compression.  The drives are stacked
on top of each other and the controller in the TA91, vs. sitting side-by-side
in the TA90[E].
