John,
You probably are trying to specify a particular user, e.g.	
	hostname
	username
	TCPIP
Under TCPIP, you have to allow access to everyone on the remote node by
using an * for the username field. Also, if running on a VAXstation that is
actually being used as an X-term (or if your DNS isn't working right), you will
need to use the numeric address for the other system  nnn.nnn.nnn.nnn

