Back when I was running ANU as a newsreader (and server!), I'd
do this:

$ SEARCH NEWS_ROOT:[COMP.OS.VMS]*.ITM "resnick"

Worked for me, and would work for you if your ANU News is acting
as a news server.

If you're only running ANU as a news reader and the articles are
somewhere else ... well, you shouldn't.  ANU is a pig/dog hybrid.
