Just for the record, sure you can.  The best way to do this, IMHO, is
to use "set dir=/path/to/new/tmp/dir" in your .exrc file.  It is also
possible through "setenv EXINIT 'dir=/path/to/new/tmp/dir'" in your
.cshrc file.  Or you could get the sources for vi :) and change the
aforementioned variable.  Or even compile [elvis|cvi|dvi].

